( 3... d3 { [%name 3...d3 Declined] Black gives the pawn back to keep the c-file closed. }
  4. Bxd3 { Developing with the capture. }
  4... Nc6 5. Nf3 d6 6. O-O Nf6 7. c4 { A Maróczy-style grip on d5 with an extra tempo. } )
4. Nxc3 { The knight takes back with development. }
